{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Only Up: SKIBIDI TOGETHER",
    "steam_appid": 2928650,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928650/extras/c9b9d7dda178911f1a61a3968bad6db1.avif?t=1752869315\" width=600 height=80 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to the world of dizzying ONLY UP: SKIBIDI TOGETHER! </h2><br>The game is an ultimate challenge that will challenge your skills. Compete against friends and players from all over the world, overcoming tricky obstacles and conquering incredible heights to become one of the few to conquer all heights. There is no margin for error here - one wrong step and you will fly down. Are you ready to demonstrate your parkour skills and climb to the top?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Only upwards, towards new heights!</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928650/extras/90ea90cbb5db2a2ddcdb14af438b6540.poster.avif?t=1752869315\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928650/extras/90ea90cbb5db2a2ddcdb14af438b6540.webm?t=1752869315\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928650/extras/90ea90cbb5db2a2ddcdb14af438b6540.mp4?t=1752869315\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Your sense of timing and precision will be crucial. The tracks are designed to keep you in suspense, ensuring that every metre will be a stern test for you and your friends.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928650/extras/058ef1777e5a3774daa59b9e781e75b0.poster.avif?t=1752869315\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928650/extras/058ef1777e5a3774daa59b9e781e75b0.webm?t=1752869315\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928650/extras/058ef1777e5a3774daa59b9e781e75b0.mp4?t=1752869315\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2>.<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Multiplayer: Compete with friends and players from all over the world. Co-op up to 8 players!<br></li><li>Interesting mechanics: Push an enemy or help a friend up.<br></li><li>Tactile control: we have created one of the best character control systems, now everything will depend only on your hand skills<br></li><li>Graphics: nice atmospheric graphics will allow you to immerse yourself in a world where the only thing that matters is climbing up!</li></ul><br>Will you be strong enough to rise above your rivals and become a parkour legend in Only Up: SKIBIDI TOGETHER? The challenges are tough, but the rewards are great. Prove your strength, conquer the course and add your name to the list of the greatest parkour champions of all time!<br><br>\u00a9 2024. All copyrights reserved.",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928650/extras/c9b9d7dda178911f1a61a3968bad6db1.avif?t=1752869315\" width=600 height=80 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to the world of dizzying ONLY UP: SKIBIDI TOGETHER! </h2><br>The game is an ultimate challenge that will challenge your skills. Compete against friends and players from all over the world, overcoming tricky obstacles and conquering incredible heights to become one of the few to conquer all heights. There is no margin for error here - one wrong step and you will fly down. Are you ready to demonstrate your parkour skills and climb to the top?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Only upwards, towards new heights!</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928650/extras/90ea90cbb5db2a2ddcdb14af438b6540.poster.avif?t=1752869315\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928650/extras/90ea90cbb5db2a2ddcdb14af438b6540.webm?t=1752869315\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928650/extras/90ea90cbb5db2a2ddcdb14af438b6540.mp4?t=1752869315\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Your sense of timing and precision will be crucial. The tracks are designed to keep you in suspense, ensuring that every metre will be a stern test for you and your friends.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928650/extras/058ef1777e5a3774daa59b9e781e75b0.poster.avif?t=1752869315\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928650/extras/058ef1777e5a3774daa59b9e781e75b0.webm?t=1752869315\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928650/extras/058ef1777e5a3774daa59b9e781e75b0.mp4?t=1752869315\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2>.<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Multiplayer: Compete with friends and players from all over the world. Co-op up to 8 players!<br></li><li>Interesting mechanics: Push an enemy or help a friend up.<br></li><li>Tactile control: we have created one of the best character control systems, now everything will depend only on your hand skills<br></li><li>Graphics: nice atmospheric graphics will allow you to immerse yourself in a world where the only thing that matters is climbing up!</li></ul><br>Will you be strong enough to rise above your rivals and become a parkour legend in Only Up: SKIBIDI TOGETHER? The challenges are tough, but the rewards are great. Prove your strength, conquer the course and add your name to the list of the greatest parkour champions of all time!<br><br>\u00a9 2024. All copyrights reserved.",
    "short_description": "Only Up: SKIBIDI TOGETHER is an incredible multiplayer parkour game where precision and speed are important. Jump and climb over various obstacles. The slightest mistake can result in a fall to the starting location.",
